      "answerFormula": "1000000 / (2 * PI * f * C)",
      "answerType": "numeric",
      "unitLabel": "Ω",
      "roundTo": 1,
      "explanation": "{C}μF = {C} ÷ 1000000 F。XC = 1 ÷ (2πfC) = 1000000 ÷ (2 × 3.14 × {f} × {C}) ≒ 1000000 ÷ {w} ≒ {answer}Ω。",
      "tags": [
        "計算",
        "リアクタンス"
